'''Wildtusk Village''' is a forest troll settlement located in [[Arathi Highlands]]. It is home to the survivors of the razed [[Zul'Rasaz tribe]]. The hamlet links to the Hinterlands via the winding Rasaz Trails.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20260514170802/https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps New Zones & World Edits]. Archived from [https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps the original] on 2026-05-14. Retrieved on 2026-29-08.</ref>

